# The Spoonacular key normally lives in the app's Settings screen (stored via
# Capacitor Preferences on-device). This file exists only if you want to seed a
# key for local web dev instead of typing it in the UI each time.
#
# Vite exposes only vars prefixed with VITE_. If you wire this up, read it via
# import.meta.env.VITE_SPOONACULAR_KEY in src/api/spoonacular.js as a fallback.
# (Not wired by default — the Settings screen is the source of truth.)

VITE_SPOONACULAR_KEY=
